      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<h2><span style=\"color: #323232;\">LIFEPAK® 15 AC Power Adapter</span></h2>\n<p>The AC Power Adapter (ACPA) is intended for use with the LIFEPAK 15 (LP15) monitor/defibrillator. The power adapter consists of an AC power adapter, AC power cord, and power adapter output cable. An optional output extension cable is available.&nbsp;Stryker has identified an increase in number of complaints related to LP15 ACPA failures with the reported symptoms of “Battery Not Charging” and “Auxiliary Power Will Not Power Device or Charge Batteries”.&nbsp; This issue is only applicable to ACPAs used on 110V power grids.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>For more information, please visit the following page:</p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/emergency-care/product-notices/lp15-acpa.html\" title=\"Learm more about LP15 ACPA notice \"><span class=\"standalone-link\">LP15 ACPA Notice</span></a><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Nov 03 2023 14:46:36 GMT+0000",
